{"id": "sf-inactive-cellular-lines", "title": "San Francisco had 2,117 idle cellular lines without an approved use", "seconds": 51.4, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "6e4b80944890b080", "words": 143, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "In July 2025, San Francisco identified 2,117 idle cellular lines.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 6.21, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "2,117", "label": "Idle lines without an approved use"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.51, 0.8, 1.71, 1.94, 2.52, 3.13, 3.36, 3.8, 3.99, 4.28, 4.88, 5.14, 5.58]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Departments had no approved business use on record for those lines.", "t0": 6.33, "t1": 9.55, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Departments had no approved business use on record for those lines"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.51, 0.72, 0.91, 1.26, 1.67, 1.91, 2.09, 2.39, 2.53, 2.78]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The budget analyst estimated $82,000 in monthly service fees.", "t0": 9.67, "t1": 13.53, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$82,000", "label": "Estimated monthly service fees"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.47, 0.91, 1.44, 1.9, 2.31, 2.69, 2.82, 3.14, 3.49]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The review covered four wireless services.", "t0": 13.65, "t1": 15.68, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The review covered four wireless services"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.45, 0.77, 1.04, 1.47]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "A second SIM card in a police vehicle can serve a purpose.", "t0": 15.9, "t1": 18.8, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "policy", "kicker": "Mobile device policy", "text": "Review of Device Inventory", "mark": "Review of Device Inventory"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.49, 0.75, 1.02, 1.12, 1.19, 1.55, 1.93, 2.11, 2.36, 2.43]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Departments documented why they needed 1,510 other idle lines.", "t0": 18.92, "t1": 23.31, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Departments documented why they needed 1,510 other idle lines"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.53, 1.14, 1.34, 1.51, 1.86, 2.09, 2.57, 2.87, 3.16, 3.41, 3.69, 3.95]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "Technology staff had already removed 1,161 FirstNet lines over two years.", "t0": 23.43, "t1": 28.7, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "1,161", "label": "FirstNet lines removed"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.6, 0.94, 1.08, 1.42, 1.8, 2.01, 2.46, 2.66, 2.98, 3.61, 4.11, 4.45, 4.66, 4.88]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "Department managers controlled which lines to disconnect.", "t0": 28.82, "t1": 31.49, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Department managers controlled which lines to disconnect"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.49, 0.92, 1.41, 1.68, 2.01, 2.13]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[3]"], "text": "At the hearing, the analyst estimated $984,000 in potential annual savings.", "t0": 31.71, "t1": 36.93, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$984,000", "label": "Potential annual savings"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.29, 0.92, 1.12, 1.52, 2.09, 2.32, 2.57, 3.05, 3.44, 3.82, 3.93, 4.39, 4.7]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[3]"], "text": "That assumed departments could eliminate every monthly charge for a full year.", "t0": 37.05, "t1": 40.71, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "That assumed departments could eliminate every monthly charge for a full year"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.59, 1.07, 1.23, 1.83, 2.16, 2.52, 2.86, 3.02, 3.09, 3.36]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["status"], "text": "In February 2026, the department again prioritized removing unused devices.", "t0": 40.83, "t1": 45.7, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "budget", "kicker": "February 2026", "text": "Citywide Cost Savings", "mark": "Citywide Cost Savings"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.64, 0.92, 1.78, 1.93, 2.41, 2.72, 3.47, 3.91, 4.29]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["status"], "text": "The City’s realized savings remain unverified.", "t0": 45.82, "t1": 48.23, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The City’s realized savings remain unverified"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.43, 0.89, 1.33, 1.65]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 48.35, "t1": 50.46, "shot": "r12", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.63, 0.79, 1.03, 1.11, 1.21, 1.47, 1.75]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "The July inventory", "b": "Which lines to keep", "o": "Potential savings"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "number"}